        "original_id": "6ee1a024-a2f6-5da9-a162-2272a7775894",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Selby\n- Events: FFB Open; European Tour 2012/2013 – Event 6; 2013 Arcaden Munich Open\n- Places: Leicester; Sheffield, England; Fürstenfeldbruck, Germany\n- Organizations: World Snooker Academy\n- Topics: professional snooker\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Selby was born on 19 June 1983.\n- Mark Selby is an English professional snooker player from Leicester.\n- The Betfair European Tour 2012/2013 – Event 6 was also known as the 2013 FFB Open and the 2013 Arcaden Munich Open.\n- The Betfair European Tour 2012/2013 – Event 6 was a professional minor-ranking snooker tournament.\n- The first three rounds of the Betfair European Tour 2012/2013 – Event 6 took place on 26–27 November 2012 at the World Snooker Academy in Sheffield, England.\n- The last-32 stage onward of the Betfair European Tour 2012/2013 – Event 6 took place on 4–6 January 2013 at the Event Forum in Fürstenfeldbruck, Germany.\n- Mark Selby was the last champion of the FFB Open.",
